%2FL22\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <span title=\"數位物件識別號\">\n         doi:10.3847/2041-8205/824/2/L22\n        </span>\n       </a>\n       <span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; cursor: default; color:var(--color-subtle, #54595d); font-size: 0.8em; bottom: 0.1em; font-weight: bold;\" title=\"连接到英语网页\">\n        （英语）\n       </span>\n       .\n      </cite>\n      <span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fzh.wikipedia.org%3A%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%A2%E6%96%AF-%E6%B3%A2%E5%BE%97%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%99&amp;rft.atitle=Corralling+a+distant+planet+with+extreme+resonant+Kuiper+belt+objects&amp;rft.au=Kathryn+Volk&amp;rft.au=Renu+Malhotra&amp;rft.au=Xianyu+Wang&amp;rft.date=2016-03-09&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.issue=2&amp;rft.jtitle=%27%27The+Astrophysical+Journal%27%27&amp;rft.pages=L22&amp;rft.volume=824&amp;rft_id=info%3Aarxiv%2F1603.02196&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.3847%2F2041-8205%2F824%2F2%2FL22&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal\">\n       <span style=\"display:none;\">\n       </span>\n      </span>\n     </span>\n    </li>\n   </ol>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\">\n   <h2 id=\"外部連結\">\n    <span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\">\n    </span>\n    外部連結\n   </h2>\n   <span class=\"mw-editsection\">\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     [\n    </span>\n    <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%A2%E6%96%AF-%E6%B3%A2%E5%BE%97%E5%AE%9A%E5%88%99&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"编辑章节：外部連結\">\n     <span>\n      编辑\n     </span>\n    </a>\n    <span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">\n     ]\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.newscientist.com/article/mg14219202.300-science-the-ghostly-hand-that-spaced-the-planets-.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     The ghostly hand that spaced the planets\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20140714212459/http://www.newscientist.com/article/mg14219202.300-science-the-ghostly-hand-that-spaced-the-planets-.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ） New Scientist 9 April 1994, p13\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://home.kpn.nl/oudfit/pp/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Plants and Planets: The Law of Titius-Bode explained\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210718131342/http://home.kpn.nl/oudfit/pp/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ） by H.J.R. Perdijk\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://media.wix.com/ugd/61b5e4_d5cf415763b44680806a8431ba375db2.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Distancias planetarias y ley de Titius-Bode\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210916040807/http://media.wix.com/ugd/61b5e4_d5cf415763b44680806a8431ba375db2.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ） (Spanish) by Dr. Ramon Parés\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐7bdf4b79bc‐5csqn\nCached time: 20260606132034\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.221 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.303 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 253/1000000\nRevision size: 5156/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 21520/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 244/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8313/5000000 bytes\nLu